{
  "doc": "A scooter built by the people of each trade at the same time, from the skills of the vehicle trades: a welder makes the underbone frame, a molder the panels of the body, an electrician the lamps, an upholsterer the seat, mechanics the fork, the bars, the engine with its swing arm and the fasteners, wheelwrights the two cast wheels, a smith the shock spring and the center stand. The shapes are the data of a Honda Vision 110 (2021, Việt Nam); another scooter is another blueprint with its own shapes. The seat turns up, the fork steers, the engine moves on its shock, the stand turns down, the wheels turn. The origin is on the ground at the center of the scooter; the front is to +y.",
